WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.534
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.968
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.634
And now if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:07.901
According to a new report,
the Justice Department

00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.667
was prepared to obtain a warrant

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.767
if President Biden did not agree
to last week's search

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.067
of his Delaware home.

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:16.868
Oh, he's not the kind of guy
who won't let you in.

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:19.434
He's the kind of guy
who won't let you leave.

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:21.267
"Come on, guys."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:23.734
"One more Michelob.
I'm gonna get out my guitar."

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:27.634
New York Mayor Eric Adams told
reporters yesterday

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.467
he does not believe asylum
seekers

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:31.501
should qualify
for the same protections

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:34.434
that require the city to provide
shelter to homeless people.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.701
In related news,
the Statue of Liberty

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:38.300
walked into the Hudson River.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:42.801
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:44.901
gave his first floor speech
yesterday

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:47.267
and quoted former President
Ronald Reagan,

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.767
or as Santos calls him, "Dad."

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.367 --> 00:00:52.934
"My living dad."

00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:55.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.601
Former President Trump has
reportedly begun texting.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:01.901
This news first reported
by Stormy Daniels.

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:05.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:07.400
[ Chuckles ] Throwback.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.901
Trump has already reportedly
stopped picking up calls

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:14.133
from numbers
that are not in his contacts,

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.501
which is surprising
since you'd think he'd jump

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:19.567
at the chance to pick up
a call that says "scam likely."

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.267
"I think you and I are going to
have a lot in common..."

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.267
[ Laughter ]
"...Scam Likely."

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:27.934
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:28.801
Transportat--

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:30.100
That was
his Secret Service name.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:35.367
The Transportation Department
has announced

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.734
that it is in the early stages
of its investigation

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:40.434
into Southwest Airlines'
handling of flight cancelations

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:42.033
during last month's
holiday season...

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:45.000
and should be done by the time
everyone makes it home.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:50.100
A new study suggests
that Earth's inner core

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:53.133
may have stopped turning
and could go in reverse.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.634
Shouldn't have
gotten the vaccine.

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:58.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:04.434
A passenger on an Emirates
flight to Dubai

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:06.234
recently gave birth midflight.

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:10.467
Not to be outdone, a passenger
on Spirit...got pregnant!

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:14.734
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:20.701
I just used a technique called
Amy Poehler-ing the punch line.

00:02:20.701 --> 00:02:23.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.934
And finally, authorities
in Connecticut

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.868
are looking for a thief
who recently stole

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.133
two designer bags
and a hairless cat,

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:32.334
or as the thief believed,
three designer bags.

00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:33.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:36.901
"Oh [no audio]"

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:38.767
[ Hissing ]

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:41.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:43.534
That was a monologue, everybody.
We're off!

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:45.133
We're off and running!
[ Cheers and applause ]

